302/1076/1113). This is a real silent divergence — callers of the public API get different feeding math than the engine uses internally. Must be unified."},{"amendment_id":"fr-1-e9bc2a44","decision":"reject","rationale":"Verified in the current tree: crates/tank_core/tests/shrimp_population.rs lines 260-261 already place the reserve in state.animal.juvenile.reserve_g (not adult.reserve_g as the amendment claims). The juvenile_to_subadult function at shrimp.rs:670 reads from state.animal.juvenile.reserve_g, matching the test. This amendment describes an already-fixed issue; the test passes as-is."},{"amendment_id":"fr-1-b5357512","decision":"accept","rationale":"Confirmed: budget_helpers.rs:249 uses TrimPlantsAndRemove but asserts N/C conservation (closed-system), contradicting engine.rs:600+ which implements export semantics. Additionally, line 259 searches for label 'action:trim_plants' but engine.rs:791 records 'action:trim_plants_and_remove'. Both the conservation assertion and the label lookup are wrong; this test currently fails."},{"amendment_id":"fr-1-264c0ac6","decision":"accept","rationale":"This covers the same failing test as fr-1-b5357512 (budget_helpers.rs trim_plants_is_closed_system_via_helpers) and is factually correct about both the stale label and the export-vs-conservation mismatch. While it overlaps with b5357512, it provides a correct diagnosis with slightly different remediation options (switch to TrimPlantsAndLeaveCuttings or assert net export). Both identify the same real defect."},{"amendment_id":"fr-1-f4085f8d","decision":"accept","rationale":"Confirmed: plant_algae_integration.rs:195-217 test trim_plants_routes_mass_to_detritus applies TrimPlantsAndRemove (line 208) then asserts fine_detritus_g_total matches expected detritus from trimmed mass (lines 216-217). But engine.rs:600-631 only routes trimmed biomass to detritus for TrimPlantsAndLeaveCuttings; the Remove variant exports it out of the system. The test's assertion contradicts the implementation and fails."}]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"93e49c58-3e27-4717-84b6-bb343fd8a32d"}
